-- A mother's two tables for each band.
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH AN `Oz mother's tables`
DECIDE `the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band IS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `the Oz band under 50` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א'3 under 50`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א'3 under 50`
    WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band over 55` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א'3 over 55`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א'3 over 55`

-- The asterisk under each table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא), §26(י)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p3 akn:att_4__hc_1/p5 akn:att_4__hc_1/p7 akn:att_4__hc_1/p9 akn:att_4__hc_1/p11 akn:att_4__hc_1/p13
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex א'3 asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex א'3 changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The note under the tables: frontal and role hours that are not whole
-- take the individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and
-- the position is all the hours over the full position's — the full
-- position of the mother's own table, as F-oz-founding-annex-b-a reads
-- "בסיס המשרה" (common: `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping
-- her week`, `what the mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours`).
-- A mother keeping her week is paid on her position and the annex's step;
-- one cutting her hours works the (ב) table's next column — one frontal
-- hour less — and is paid on its position and the step, her position
-- staying the one she would have had.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p14
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours, of the week she would have had
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex א'3 gives a mother keeping her week` band f IS
    `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping her week` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band) f

GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours, of the week she would have had
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex א'3 gives a mother cutting her hours` band f IS
    `what the mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band) f

§§ `נספח א'3 -- the checks`

-- Each table opens at the full position (in a (א) table, the position she
-- would have had) and steps down a frontal hour at a time; the annex adds
-- one step in all three bands.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the annexed table opens at the full position` ((`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band)'s `the table under (א)`) AND `the annexed table opens at the full position` ((`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band)'s `the table under (ב)`)) `the Oz age bands`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` ((`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band)'s `the table under (א)`) AND `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` ((`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band)'s `the table under (ב)`)) `the Oz age bands`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the points the mother's tables add` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` band) EQUALS `the points the mother's tables add` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` `the Oz band under 50`)) `the Oz age bands`

-- The tables' arithmetic (F-oz-founding-annex-g-a): each presence is its
-- column's hours, and each position she would have had in a (ב) table is
-- its hours over the table's full position — in every cell but these.
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א'3 under 50` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 under 50` EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 under 50` `the presence row` 2 35
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א'3 over 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 over 55` EQUALS EMPTY

-- The mother's pattern (F-oz-founding-annex-a-a): in each (ב) table the
-- position she is paid on is the one she would have had and the annex's
-- step; each (א) table's column k is its (ב) table's column k+1, with the
-- position she would have had of the (ב) column k, paid on the column's
-- position and the step — in every cell but these.
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` `the Oz band under 50`) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`) EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` `the position row` 3 (98.75%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` `the position row` 1 (102.89%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` `the position row` 2 (96.48%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` `the position row` 3 (92.59%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א'3 from 50 to 55` `the position row` 4 (89.65%)
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` `the Oz band over 55`) EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the (ב) table of annex א'3 over 55` `the position row` 3 (96.23%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א'3 over 55` `the position row` 2 (96.23%)

§§ `נספח א'3 -- illustrations`

-- From 50 to 55, keeping a week of 20 frontal hours: 31 hours of 34,
-- 91.18%, paid on 98.78% — where the column prints 98.75%. Cutting her
-- hours from 22: the column of 21, 32.5 hours, paid on 103.19% — where the
-- (א) table prints 102.89%.
#ASSERT `what annex א'3 gives a mother keeping her week` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 20 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20 4.5 6.5) (91.18%) (98.78%))
#ASSERT `what annex א'3 gives a mother cutting her hours` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 22 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 21 5 6.5) (100%) (103.19%))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex א'3 changes the length of a teaching period`
